/* LunaChat - 夜紫主题（与登录页同一套配色：深紫底 + 紫蓝强调 + 玻璃卡片） */
QWidget {
    background-color: #191233;
    color: #E9E5F5;
    font-family: "Microsoft YaHei UI", "Segoe UI";
    font-size: 13px;
}
QMainWindow, QDialog { background-color: #191233; }

/* ---------------- 自绘标题栏 ---------------- */
QWidget#TitleBar {
    background-color: #151029;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
}
QLabel#TitleBarTitle { color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
QLabel#TitleBarSubtitle { color: #8E86B0; font-size: 11px; }
QPushButton#TitleBarButton {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.66);
    font-size: 15px;
}
QPushButton#TitleBarButton:hover { background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10); color: #FFFFFF; }
QPushButton#TitleBarButton:pressed { background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16); }
QPushButton#TitleBarClose {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.66);
    font-size: 16px;
}
QPushButton#TitleBarClose:hover { background-color: #E5484D; color: #FFFFFF; }
QPushButton#TitleBarClose:pressed { background-color: #C93C41; }

/* ---------------- 左侧栏 ---------------- */
#Sidebar { background-color: #151029; border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); }
QPushButton#SidebarButton {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    color: #E9E5F5;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
}
QPushButton#SidebarButton:hover {
    background-color: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.32);
    border-color: rgba(139, 123, 255, 0.55);
    color: #FFFFFF;
}
QLabel#SectionLabel { color: #8E86B0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 8px 4px 2px 4px; }

/* ---------------- 会话列表 ---------------- */
QListWidget#ChannelList {
    background-color: transparent;
    border: none;
    outline: 0;
}
QListWidget#ChannelList::item {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    margin: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: #A79ECB;
}
QListWidget#ChannelList::item:hover {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    color: #F4F1FF;
}
QListWidget#ChannelList::item:selected {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:1,
                                stop:0 rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.45),
                                stop:1 rgba(77, 141, 255, 0.28));
    color: #FFFFFF;
}

/* ---------------- 聊天区 ---------------- */
QLabel#ChatTitle {
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 2px 4px 2px 4px;
    background: transparent;
}
QLabel#ChatSubtitle { color: #9C93C4; font-size: 11px; padding: 0 4px 8px 4px; background: transparent; }
QLabel#LoginCaption { color: #9C93C4; font-size: 12px; background: transparent; }
QFrame#SettingsCard QLabel { background: transparent; }
QListWidget#FriendResultList { background: transparent; border: none; }
QWidget#FriendResultRow { background: transparent; border-radius: 10px; }
QWidget#FriendResultRow:hover { background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); }
QToolTip {
    background-color: #1C1540;
    color: #F4F1FF;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 6px 8px;
}
QTableCornerButton::section { background: transparent; border: none; }
QFrame#SettingsCard QLabel#Avatar {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:1, stop:0 #7C5CFF, stop:1 #4D8DFF);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
}
QFrame#SettingsCard QLabel#GroupAvatarBig {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:1, stop:0 #7C5CFF, stop:1 #4D8DFF);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 42px;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 700;
}

QScrollArea#MessageList { background: transparent; border: none; }
QWidget#MessageContainer { background: transparent; }
QWidget#MessageRow { background: transparent; border-radius: 10px; }
QWidget#MessageRow:hover { background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035); }

QLabel#Avatar {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:1, stop:0 #7C5CFF, stop:1 #4D8DFF);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
}
QLabel#AvatarSelf {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:1, stop:0 #3A2C6E, stop:1 #2A2150);
    color: #E9E5F5;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
}
QLabel#MessageHead { color: #C9C2E4; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; }
QLabel#MessageBody { color: #E9E5F5; }
QLabel#MessageBubble {
    color: #F4F1FF;
    background-color: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.14);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
}

/* ---------------- 输入区 ---------------- */
QLineEdit#MessageInput {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    color: #F4F1FF;
    selection-background-color: #7C5CFF;
}
QLineEdit#MessageInput:focus {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 123, 255, 0.75);
}

/* ---------------- 通用按钮 ---------------- */
QPushButton {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    color: #F4F1FF;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 7px 14px;
}
QPushButton:hover {
    background-color: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.30);
    border-color: rgba(139, 123, 255, 0.55);
    color: #FFFFFF;
}
QPushButton:pressed { background-color: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.45); }
QPushButton:disabled {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.32);
}

QPushButton#PrimaryButton {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:0, stop:0 #7C5CFF, stop:1 #4D8DFF);
    border: none;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-weight: 600;
}
QPushButton#PrimaryButton:hover {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:0, stop:0 #8E70FF, stop:1 #5F9BFF);
}
QPushButton#PrimaryButton:pressed {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:0, stop:0 #6A4BE8, stop:1 #3F7BEA);
}
QPushButton#PrimaryButton:disabled {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
}

QToolButton { background: transparent; border: none; border-radius: 10px; padding: 4px; }
QToolButton:hover { background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09); }
QToolButton#PageBackButton, QToolButton#ChatIconButton { border-radius: 20px; }
QToolButton#PageBackButton:hover, QToolButton#ChatIconButton:hover {
    background-color: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.30);
}

/* ---------------- 输入控件 ---------------- */
QLineEdit, QPlainTextEdit, QTextEdit, QComboBox, QSpinBox, QDateTimeEdit {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 7px 10px;
    color: #F4F1FF;
    selection-background-color: #7C5CFF;
    selection-color: #FFFFFF;
}
QLineEdit:focus, QPlainTextEdit:focus, QTextEdit:focus {
    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 123, 255, 0.85);
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
}
QComboBox::drop-down { border: none; width: 24px; }
QComboBox QAbstractItemView {
    background-color: #1C1540;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 4px;
    selection-background-color: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.35);
    color: #F4F1FF;
}

/* ---------------- 列表 / 表格 ---------------- */
QListWidget, QTableWidget, QScrollArea, QListView {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 12px;
    outline: 0;
}
QListWidget::item, QTableWidget::item { padding: 6px; border-radius: 8px; }
QListWidget::item:selected, QTableWidget::item:selected {
    background-color: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.32);
    color: #FFFFFF;
}
QListWidget#GroupFilesList { background-color: transparent; border: none; }
QHeaderView::section {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: #9C93C4;
    border: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 8px 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
}
QTableWidget { gridline-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); }

/* ---------------- 菜单 / 状态栏 / 进度 ---------------- */
QMenu {
    background-color: #1C1540;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 6px;
}
QMenu::item { padding: 7px 18px; border-radius: 8px; }
QMenu::item:selected { background-color: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.40); color: #FFFFFF; }

QStatusBar { background-color: #120E26; color: #8E86B0; }
QProgressBar {
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    text-align: center;
    color: #F4F1FF;
    height: 8px;
}
QProgressBar::chunk {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:0, stop:0 #7C5CFF, stop:1 #4D8DFF);
    border-radius: 4px;
}
QCheckBox { spacing: 8px; color: #E9E5F5; }

QFrame#SettingsCard {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 16px;
}

QSlider::groove:horizontal {
    height: 4px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
    border-radius: 2px;
}
QSlider::sub-page:horizontal {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:0, stop:0 #7C5CFF, stop:1 #4D8DFF);
    border-radius: 2px;
}
QSlider::handle:horizontal {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    margin: -6px 0;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 2px solid #7C5CFF;
}
QSlider::handle:horizontal:hover { border-color: #9C8BFF; }
QSlider::add-page:horizontal { background: transparent; }

/* ---------------- 滚动条 ---------------- */
QScrollBar:vertical { background: transparent; width: 8px; margin: 2px; }
QScrollBar::handle:vertical {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
    border-radius: 4px;
    min-height: 30px;
}
QScrollBar::handle:vertical:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28); }
QScrollBar::add-line:vertical, QScrollBar::sub-line:vertical { height: 0; }
QScrollBar:horizontal { background: transparent; height: 8px; margin: 2px; }
QScrollBar::handle:horizontal {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
    border-radius: 4px;
    min-width: 30px;
}
QScrollBar::handle:horizontal:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28); }
QScrollBar::add-line:horizontal, QScrollBar::sub-line:horizontal { width: 0; }

/* ---------------- 最左侧图标栏 ---------------- */
QWidget#IconRail { background-color: #0F0A21; border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); }
QToolButton#RailButton {
    border: none;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    color: #C9C2E4;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
}
QToolButton#RailButton:hover { background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13); color: #FFFFFF; }
QToolButton#RailButton:checked { background-color: transparent; color: #FFFFFF; }
QWidget#RailHighlight {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:1, stop:0 #7C5CFF, stop:1 #4D8DFF);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
    border-radius: 22px;
}

/* ---------------- 头像 / 页头 ---------------- */
QLabel#ChatHeaderAvatar {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:1, stop:0 #7C5CFF, stop:1 #4D8DFF);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
}
QLabel#GroupAvatarBig {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:1, stop:0 #7C5CFF, stop:1 #4D8DFF);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 42px;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 700;
}

/* ---------------- 朋友圈 ---------------- */
QWidget#MomentPage {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:1,
                                stop:0 #241B4E, stop:0.55 #191233, stop:1 #0D0A1C);
}
QScrollArea#MomentScroll, QWidget#MomentViewport, QWidget#MomentContainer {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
}
QFrame#MomentCard {
    background-color: rgba(16, 12, 36, 0.64);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: 14px;
}
QFrame#MomentCard:hover {
    background-color: rgba(26, 20, 54, 0.78);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.20);
}
QPushButton#MomentFab {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:1, stop:0 #7C5CFF, stop:1 #4D8DFF);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 28px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
}
QPushButton#MomentFab:hover {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:1, stop:0 #8E70FF, stop:1 #5F9BFF);
}
QPushButton#MomentFab:pressed {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:1, stop:0 #6A4BE8, stop:1 #3F7BEA);
}
QLabel#MomentComments {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    color: #C9C2E4;
    font-size: 12px;
}
QWidget#MomentBanner { background: transparent; }
QLabel#MomentBannerName { color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; background: transparent; }
QLabel#MomentBannerHint { color: #D9D1F7; font-size: 11px; background: transparent; }
QLabel#MomentBannerAvatar {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    color: #5A3FD6;
    border-radius: 32px;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
}
QFrame#MomentCard QLabel { background: transparent; }
QFrame#MomentCard QToolButton { background: transparent; border: none; }
QToolButton#MomentAvatar { background: transparent; border: none; }
QToolButton#MomentAvatar:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10); border-radius: 22px; }

QPushButton#MomentBackButton, QPushButton#MomentBgButton {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
}
QPushButton#MomentBackButton:hover, QPushButton#MomentBgButton:hover {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.26);
}

QLabel#ChatDateLabel {
    color: #8F86B8;
    font-size: 11px;
    background: transparent;
    padding: 4px 12px;
}

QToolButton#SidebarIconButton {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: 10px;
}
QToolButton#SidebarIconButton:hover {
    background-color: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.28);
    border-color: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.55);
}
QPushButton#SegmentButton {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 9px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    color: #9C93C4;
    font-size: 12px;
}
QPushButton#SegmentButton:hover { color: #F4F1FF; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); }
QPushButton#SegmentButton:checked {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:0, stop:0 #7C5CFF, stop:1 #4D8DFF);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border-color: transparent;
}
QListWidget#RequestList { background: transparent; border: none; }
QWidget#MomentCommentEditor { background: transparent; }

QFrame#ConfirmCard {
    background-color: #1C1540;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
    border-radius: 16px;
}
QFrame#ConfirmCard QLabel { background: transparent; }
QPushButton#DangerButton {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:0, stop:0 #FF6B81, stop:1 #E0455F);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 9px;
    padding: 7px 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
}
QPushButton#DangerButton:hover {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:0, stop:0 #FF8397, stop:1 #F05A73);
}